      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        156.63470458984375,
        265.97906494140625,
        175.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "OK good idea Rosie. Let’s do that.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        188.25205993652344,
        110.42239379882812,
        207.75344848632812
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        208.2346954345703,
        400.8572998046875,
        227.03359985351562
      ],
      "text": "I love living in a big city but of course there are problems.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        239.97206115722656,
        111.62239837646484,
        259.47344970703125
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        260.0746765136719,
        245.42172241210938,
        278.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "Things like theft and robbery?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        291.6920471191406,
        110.42239379882812,
        311.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        311.793701171875,
        522.175048828125,
        390.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "Yes, but where I come from, that’s linked to another more serious issue, which\nis that a lot of people don’t have jobs. That’s getting worse and worse. And we\nalso still have quite a lot of people who are homeless, though that’s not quite\nso bad as it was.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.0520324707031,
        111.62239837646484,
        422.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        423.0346984863281,
        505.82208251953125,
        461.75360107421875
      ],
      "text": "It would be nice to talk about some positive developments, like some of the\nnew developments on the outskirts of cities.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.6920471191406,
        110.42239379882812,
        494.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        494.6746826171875,
        502.2582092285156,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, they’ve opened some massive new shopping centres outside my city.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.4110107421875,
        111.62239837646484,
        545.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "COLIN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        546.3937377929688,
        522.8619384765625,
        605.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, the same with mine, but it means a lot of the shops in the city centre are\nclosing down. But the outskirts are ideal for buildings that need a lot of space,\nlike for conferences. They’ve opened a couple of big ones.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        617.85205078125,
        110.42239379882812,
        637.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "ROSIE:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        637.834716796875,
        498.14093017578125,
        676.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "Yes, we’ve got some too. It’d be nicer to have more facilities for things like\nfootball too, but that’s not happening where I live.\n"
    },
